# Problem Statement

## Project Title
Clothing Inventory & Catalog Management Platform

## Domain
Retail / Boutique Management

## Problem Description
Many boutique owners manage clothing inventory manually using notebooks or spreadsheets. This can lead to incorrect stock records, difficulty finding products, and delays in updating inventory. A digital inventory management system helps maintain accurate product information and stock levels.

## Proposed Solution
Develop a full-stack web application that allows boutique owners to:
- Login securely
- Manage product categories
- Add, update and delete clothing products
- Track inventory quantity
- Search products
- View low-stock items through a dashboard

## Users
- Admin (Boutique Owner)
- Staff

## Technology Stack
- Frontend: React.js
- Backend: Spring Boot (Java)
- Database: MySQL

## Expected Outcome
The system will simplify inventory management, reduce manual work, and provide an organized way to manage clothing products and stock.
